<section aria-label="Introduction">
	<p class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg leading-[1.85] text-base-content">
		Hello. You can know me as <span class="font-bold text-secondary">Prot0x0wl</span>.
		<br /><br />
		I'm a Python backend and infrastructure engineer who has spent the last 8+ years building, deploying, and hardening production systems. I love tinkering with software and tech in both my busy and free time, and I still believe the human mind is a greater wonder than the cosmos.
		<br /><br />
		Here you'll find deep dives, pragmatic breakdowns, and musings on backend architecture, DevOps, and systems security. If you're building something interesting or just want to trade ideas, <a href={`${template.base}/cv`} class="text-secondary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-secondary/80">check out my CV</a> or <a href={`${template.base}/contact`} class="text-secondary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-secondary/80">reach out</a>.
	</p>
